<section id="about" class="section-service" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-about;"><!--[--><div class="service-about u-bg-primary all-on-x-page__about"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block"><div class="scroll-block__overlay"></div><div class="scroll-block__content scroll-block-grid"><div class="scroll-block-grid__header"><div class="scroll-block-progress"><div class="scroll-block-progress__fill"></div></div><h2 class="scroll-block__title u-text-headings-medium">About the ALL-ON-X method</h2></div><div class="scroll-block-grid__body"><div class="scroll-block__items"><!--[--><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">What is the ALL-ON-X method?</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">â€“ ALL-ON-X is an amazing dental solution that restores your entire smile using an innovative non-removable structure based on four or in some cases six implants.</div></div><div class="scroll-block-item"><div class="scroll-block-item__header"><h3 class="scroll-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">A new smile in just one day</h3><!----></div><div class="scroll-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">â€“ Unlike traditional methods, ALL-ON-X can restore functionality and aesthetics in just one day, in cases where all teeth are lost or permanently damaged.</div></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-when u-bg-primary all-on-x-page__when"><div class="list-block list-block--visible"><div class="list-block__header u-bg-primary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="list-block__title u-text-headings-large">Cases in which this solution is used</h2><div class="list-block__header-photos"><!--[--><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/ee4bfaab940d-1.avif 1x, /assets/img/717428da8f47-1.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0s;" src="/assets/img/ee4bfaab940d-1.avif"><img width="630" height="410" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/781f5b35bf42-2.avif 1x, /assets/img/889f522ac1bd-2.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" class="list-block__header-photo" style="--delay:0.2s;" src="/assets/img/781f5b35bf42-2.avif"><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="list-block__body u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><ul class="list-block__items"><!--[--><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">01</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Loss of all or nearly all teeth</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">If the patient has lost most of or all of his teeth in one or both rows of teeth, ALL-ON-X can be a good alternative to traditional prosthetic methods.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">02</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">Irreversibly damaged teeth</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">In cases where the teeth are so damaged that it is impossible to save or restore them with traditional methods, ALL-ON-X can be an effective solution.</div></div></li><li class="list-block-item" style="--delay:0.8s;"><div class="list-block-item__aside"><span class="list-block-item__number u-text-body-large">03</span></div><div class="list-block-item__body"><h3 class="list-block-item__title u-text-headings-small">In cases of an atrophied (reduced) jaw bone</h3><div class="list-block-item__description u-wysiwyg">When the volume of the jawbone has decreased, traditional implant methods may not be the best option. ALL-ON-X enables us to use the available bone tissue effectively and avoid bone augmentation or other complicated procedures.</div></div></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="service-efficiency u-bg-secondary all-on-x-page__efficiency"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-efficiency__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Precision and Efficiency<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-efficiency__body"><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/920eab9d8e39-1.avif 1x, /assets/img/e3ae609693a3-1.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded image-info-box__image image-info-box__image--visible" alt="Service Efficiency" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/920eab9d8e39-1.avif"><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">With the help of digital technologies, ALL-ON-X procedures are carefully planned — the course of the operation, the position of the implants and surgical processes are modelled before the operation, ensuring maximum precision during the operation itself.</p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Modern technologies optimise treatment, shortening operation times and improving patient comfort.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--footer"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[--><div class="service-benefits u-bg-primary all-on-x-page__benefits"><div class="wheel-block"><div class="wheel-block__sticky-content"><div class="wheel-block__header"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Main benefits of the method<!--]--></h2><!--]--></div></div><div class="wheel-block__body"><div class="wheel-block__body-inner"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="wheel-block-wheel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1202" height="1202" viewBox="0 0 1202 1202" fill="none" class="wheel-block-wheel__svg" style="--wheel-rotation-degrees-start:72deg;"><circle cx="600" cy="600" r="534.5" stroke="#DDEFDE" opacity=".2"></circle><!--[--><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(0 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">1</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(72 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">2</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(144 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">3</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(216 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">4</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><g class="wheel-step" transform="rotate(288 600 600)"><circle class="wheel-step__dot" cx="600" cy="65.5" r="5"></circle><circle class="wheel-step__bubble" cx="600" cy="20" r="20"></circle><text class="wheel-step__text" x="600" y="20" text-anchor="middle" alignment-baseline="central">5</text><path class="wheel-step__line" d="M601 90v116"></path></g><!--]--></svg><!--[--><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">A brand new smile</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">In just one day, we create a beautiful smile that transforms the patientâ€™s visual appearance and restores self-confidence.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Fast results</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">With temporary teeth available on the day you undergo surgery, you will experience a rapid transformation, restoring your smile much faster.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Reduced healing time</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">This minimally invasive method means a shorter recovery time, restoring your confidence in your smile much more quickly.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Comfortable, permanent dentures</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">Regain comfort with fixed dentures that look, feel and function like natural teeth.</p></div><div class="wheel-block-wheel__item"><h3 class="u-text-headings-small wheel-block-wheel__item-title">Improved oral cavity health</h3><p class="u-text-body-medium wheel-block-wheel__item-description">ALL-ON-X not only improves your smile, buy also promotes better hygiene, making dental care easier than ever before.</p></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="wheel-block__triggers"><!--[--><div data-nr="1" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="2" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="3" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="4" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><div data-nr="5" class="wheel-block__trigger"></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="service-price u-bg-primary all-on-x-page__price"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="callout u-bg-secondary apply-callout"><div class="callout__body"><!--[--><!--[--><h2 class="u-text-headings-small service-price__title">Current comprehensive diagnostics price</h2><p class="u-text-body-medium">After the diagnosis, you will receive a personalised treatment plan, including not only the planning of the aligners, but also other required procedures for obtaining your perfect smile</p><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__aside"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="service-price__prices"><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--old u-text-headings-small">â‚¬650</span><span class="service-price__price service-price__price--new u-text-headings-medium">â‚¬280</span></div><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="callout__cta"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-how u-bg-primary all-on-x-page__how"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="service-how-grid"><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->How does it take place?<!--]--></h2></div><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--body"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-secondary service-how__progress"></div><div class="service-how__items"><!--[--><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/80e41b65a061-1.avif 1x, /assets/img/fd7eb467a28a-1.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/80e41b65a061-1.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>1st appointment — Introductory consultation with the Head of the Clinic in the meeting room + examinations</h3>
<p>** Comprehensive diagnostics price — â‚¬280**</p>
<p>â€“ Doctorâ€™s consultation that includes finding out your wishes and ascertaining your goals.<br>
â€“ Dr. Aleksejevs will ask you questions about your prior experience and possible fears.</p>
<ul>
<li>Performing examinations: detailed examination of the oral cavity, 3D X-ray to digitize the skull and hard tissues; 3D Shape Scanner for accurate digitization of teeth (for both jaws); 3D computed tomography (CSDT); photo protocol to record the structure and features of the patientâ€™s face both intra-orally and extra-orally; A Modjaw device that will record the patientâ€™s jaw movements.</li>
</ul>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/95dab5b0ae72-2.avif 1x, /assets/img/01ecb324c299-2.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/95dab5b0ae72-2.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>2nd appointment — Treatment planning presentation</h3>
<p>** Included in the Comprehensive diagnostics price**</p>
<p>Based on the examinations, a team of 8 doctors will prepare a personalised treatment plan:</p>
<ul>
<li>future treatment steps</li>
<li>clear expenditures</li>
<li>timeframes</li>
</ul>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/1f3bf03c2fe9-3.avif 1x, /assets/img/a16f48dcbf40-3.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/1f3bf03c2fe9-3.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>3rd appointment — Insertion of teeth implants and temporary smile ALL-ON-X</h3>
<p>** Operation: Insertion of 4 or 6 implants — starting from â‚¬7000**</p>
<ul>
<li>During one appointment, the surgeon performs a painless insertion of the required implants</li>
<li>The dental technician makes a temporary prosthesis for you on the spot, which will be installed on the implants</li>
<li>This procedure is painless, as anesthesia is used, and sedation with laughing gas can also be performed for maximum relaxation</li>
<li>Approximate operation time — 8 hours, with the participation of 4 specialists</li>
<li>You leave the clinic with a temporary smile, but the visual changes are immediately visible</li>
</ul>
</div><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="service-how-item"><div class="service-how-item-grid"><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--aside"><img width="410" height="588" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/fa0beded7fd0-4.avif 1x, /assets/img/f316c9f4083f-4.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" alt="" loading="lazy" class="service-how-item__image" src="/assets/img/fa0beded7fd0-4.avif"></div><div class="service-how-item-grid__item service-how-item-grid__item--main"><div class="service-how-item__body"><div class="service-how-item__html u-wysiwyg"><h3>4th appointment — Great looking permanent teeth</h3>
<p>** After 4-6 months: Insertion of permanent teeth — â‚¬5000**</p>
<ul>
<li>After approximately 4-6 months, when the implants have  healed, great looking permanent teeth are installed, completely replacing natural teeth both visually and functionally.</li>
</ul>
</div><div class="service-how-item__footer"><div class="u-text-body-medium">Your life has changed forever — with your new smile, you feel confident every day!</div><span class="u-text-body-medium">* Deferred payment options are also available from the clinic.</span></div></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="service-how-grid__item service-how-grid__item--footer"><button class="button button--type-primary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button></div></div><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></section>
<section id="portfolio" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-portfolio;"><!--[--><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-portfolio"><div class="portfolio-story u-bg-tertiary section-portfolio__story"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-story__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our patientâ€™s story on the way to the Perfect Smile<!--]--></h2></div><div class="portfolio-story__body"><div class="portfolio-story-box u-bg-secondary"><div class="portfolio-story-box__aside"><div class="video-dialog video-dialog--type-cover portfolio-story-box__preview"><video class="video-dialog__preview" width="640" height="1138" muted="" loop="" playsinline="" src="/cms/api/media/file/sales-story-tease.webm" autoplay=""></video><button aria-label="Play video" class="video-dialog__button"><div class="icon-button icon-button--type-primary icon-button--size-medium video-dialog__play-button"><div class="icon-button__icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="54" height="54" viewBox="0 0 54 54"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22.031 19.687a1 1 0 0 1 1.515-.858l12.188 7.313a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.715L23.546 35.17a1 1 0 0 1-1.515-.857V19.687Z"></path></svg><!--]--></div></div></button><!--teleport start--><!--teleport end--></div></div><div class="portfolio-story-box__body"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><h3>Goal</h3>
<p>To improve the appearance of my smile, I was concerned about the existing composite coatings on the front teeth (fillings), which were worn, cracked, and discoloured.</p>
<h3>What we did</h3>
<ul>
<li>We performed comprehensive diagnostics â€“ collecting the patientâ€™s history, followed by oral cavity and teeth examination, 3 Shape scan, intraoral digital X-rays, KSDT (3D X-ray), photo protocol, facial analysis;</li>
<li>We prepared a personalised treatment plan, including all the required finances, implementation time, and also demonstrated a digital smile design, during which the patient was able to view before/after pictures of her smile before we started any treatment process.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Result</h3>
<p>Treatment duration 3 months:</p>
<ul>
<li>We replaced 2 missing teeth with Straumann implants,</li>
<li>We performed endodontic root canal treatment under microscope control, therapeutic treatment and smile reconstruction with 24 ceramic veneers, which were made in our technical laboratory in Dubai.</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples u-bg-tertiary section-portfolio__examples"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-examples__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Examples of our work<!--]--></h2></div><div class="portfolio-examples__body"><div class="portfolio-examples-list"><!--[--><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="6915d5911ff8253e21798ef9"><div><div id="lmjpf9k3r" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/Alberts1pÄ“c-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/Alberts1pirms-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(26, 26, 26); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
