      <path fill="none" stroke="#DDEFDE" stroke-width="2" d="M17 30.5h26m-26 0 4.645-4.5M17 30.5l4.645 4.5M43 30.5 38.355 26M43 30.5 38.355 35"></path>
    </svg>
  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(26, 26, 26); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h3><strong>Full smile reconstruction</strong></h3><p>In this clinical case, the patient came to us with a serious problem â€“ he had only six teeth left in both the upper and lower jaws. He wanted not only to restore his teeth, but also to regain a full, harmonious and natural smile that would give him confidence and look truly inspiring.</p><h3><strong>Planning and functional reconstruction</strong></h3><p>Our team started treatment with a comprehensive approach â€“ we carefully planned each stage of the treatment in order to restore both the patient's aesthetic appearance and full chewing function.&nbsp;</p><p>To replace his missing teeth, we inserted twelve Swiss <strong>Straumann</strong> implants â€“ six in the upper and lower jaws in the lateral teeth areas. These implants provided a stable foundation for zirconia crowns.</p><h3><strong>Aesthetic art</strong></h3><p>On the patient's remaining teeth, we installed exclusive ceramic veneers hand-made by our cooperation partners â€“ professional ceramic specialists in Dubai. Each veneer was custom-made to complement the patient's facial proportions, smile line and speech characteristics.</p><p>The ultra-thin ceramic layer of just 0.5&nbsp;mm made it possible to preserve natural translucency and light reflection, thus creating an outstanding aesthetic appearance with no plastic or artificial feeling.</p><h3><strong>Perfection in the details</strong></h3><p>Zirconia crowns on implants ensured the durability and longevity of the structure, while veneers gave the patient's smile a look of lightness, radiance and sophistication.&nbsp;</p><p>The whole treatment process â€“ from insertion of implants through to final prosthetics â€“ lasted seven months. The aesthetic stage with the production and installation of veneers took about four weeks.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>The result is not just a new smile â€“ it is a story of complete transformation. The patient acquired a healthy, harmonious and natural smile, which not only restored his chewing function, but also reflected his self-confidence, inner strength and improved quality of life.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="6915f169f3394b8d6b4afdd6"><div><div id="e11tcvzu0" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pÄ“c-2-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pirms-3-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(26, 26, 26); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 60 60">
