  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(26, 26, 26); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="display:none;" id="6915f1b5f3394b8d6b4afdd8"><img width="960" height="635" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens pÄ“c-960x635.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/rentgens pÄ“c-960x635.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image media-item__asset" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens pÄ“c-960x635.avif"></div><!--]--></div><div class="carousel-navigation portfolio-examples-item__navigation"><button class="carousel-navigation__button carousel-navigation__button--prev" disabled="" aria-label="Previous slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path fill="#DDEFDE" d="M11.47 20.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l4.773-4.773a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06L13.061 20l4.242 4.243a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 1.06zM28 20v.75H12v-1.5h16z"></path></svg></button><div class="carousel-navigation__counter u-text-body-medium"><span class="carousel-navigation__current">1</span><span class="carousel-navigation__separator">/</span><span class="carousel-navigation__total">2</span></div><button class="carousel-navigation__button carousel-navigation__button--next" aria-label="Next slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path fill="#DDEFDE" d="M28.53 20.53a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06l-4.773-4.773a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L26.939 20l-4.242 4.243a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06zM12 20v.75h16v-1.5H12z"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Clinical case: a smile in just one day</strong></h2><p>A patient came to us with severe periodontitis, a disease affecting gums and bone tissue. He had already lost most of his teeth, while the rest were in critical condition. This not only undermined the patient's health, it also affected his quality of life â€“ he had trouble eating, speaking, and, needless to say, he was reluctant to smile.</p><h3><strong>Solution: All-on-X concept</strong></h3><p>To restore both functionality and aesthetics, we chose the modern <strong>All-on-X</strong> method using the <strong>Neodent Neoporos implant system</strong>. This approach makes it possible to insert implants and attach a temporary restoration to them in just one day â€“ with no long wait times.</p><h3><strong>A smile in just one day</strong></h3><p>In one operation:</p><ul class="list-bullet"><li class="" style="" value="1">we removed all the patient's damaged teeth,</li><li class="" style="" value="2">inserted implants, and</li><li class="" style="" value="3">inserted a temporary fixed restoration, fastened right onto the implants.</li></ul><p>During the operation, the patient was under <strong>intravenous sedation</strong> â€“ he fell asleep calmly and awoke with a new smile. No pain and no stress.</p><h3><strong>Permanent solution</strong></h3><p>After three months, when the implants had fully taken root, we replaced the temporary structure with a permanent one â€“ zirconia teeth with a titanium base. This solution ensures longevity, durability and the most natural appearance possible.</p><h3><strong>Result</strong></h3><p>In just one day, the patient went from being in a critical situation to having a new smile and a entirely new quality of life. Now his smile is natural, functional and harmonious. But most importantly of all â€“ the patient has regained his confidence, inner balance and happiness in communicating with others.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item portfolio-examples-list__item"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media"><div class="portfolio-examples-item__media-container"><!--[--><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="" id="6915f1d7f3394b8d6b4afdd9"><div><div id="sjr2b7z00" class="vci--container media-item__asset media-item__asset--comparison" tabindex="0" data-testid="vci-container" style="display: flex; height: 344.118px;"><img class="vci--right-image" data-testid="right-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pÄ“c-3-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 0px 0px 260px);"><img class="vci--left-image" data-testid="left-image" src="/cms/api/media/file/1pirms-4-680x450.avif" style="clip-path: inset(0px 260px 0px 0px);"><div class="vci--slider" style="cursor: ew-resize !important; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; left: 240px; top: 0px; width: 40px;"><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(26, 26, 26); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div><div class="vci--custom-handle">
