  </div><div class="vci--slider-line" style="background: rgb(26, 26, 26); height: 100%; width: 2px;"></div></div><!----><!----></div></div></div><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="display:none;" id="6915f28ff3394b8d6b4afdda"><img width="960" height="634" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pirms-960x634.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pirms-960x634.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image media-item__asset" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pirms-960x634.avif"></div><div class="media-item portfolio-examples-item__media-item" style="display:none;" id="6915f29ef3394b8d6b4afddb"><img width="960" height="635" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pec-960x635.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pec-960x635.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image media-item__asset" alt="" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/rentgens-pec-960x635.avif"></div><!--]--></div><div class="carousel-navigation portfolio-examples-item__navigation"><button class="carousel-navigation__button carousel-navigation__button--prev" disabled="" aria-label="Previous slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path fill="#DDEFDE" d="M11.47 20.53a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.06l4.773-4.773a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06 1.06L13.061 20l4.242 4.243a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06 1.06zM28 20v.75H12v-1.5h16z"></path></svg></button><div class="carousel-navigation__counter u-text-body-medium"><span class="carousel-navigation__current">1</span><span class="carousel-navigation__separator">/</span><span class="carousel-navigation__total">3</span></div><button class="carousel-navigation__button carousel-navigation__button--next" aria-label="Next slide"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path fill="#DDEFDE" d="M28.53 20.53a.75.75 0 0 0 0-1.06l-4.773-4.773a.75.75 0 0 0-1.06 1.06L26.939 20l-4.242 4.243a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.06zM12 20v.75h16v-1.5H12z"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples-item__content"><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><h2><strong>Clinical case: a new smile in just one day with the All-on-X method</strong></h2><p>A patient came to us with the dream of recovering her perfect smile and self-confidence. Thanks to the state-of-the-art <strong>All-on-X</strong> treatment method, this was possible in just one day.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Essence of the method</strong></h3><p>All-on-X technology makes it possible to remove all damaged teeth in a single operation and immediately install a stable temporary prosthesis supported by implants. This approach is fast, functional and aesthetically appealing solution that enables the patient to go home the same day with a new smile.</p><h3><strong>Course of treatment</strong></h3><p>During the operation, implants were inserted into the patient's upper jaw, immediately followed by the installation of temporary structure made of <strong>PMMA </strong>(highly durable polymer) on them. After about three months of adaptation and healing, we replaced this temporary structure with a<strong> permanent zirconia prosthesis</strong> â€“ a material that combines excellent aesthetics, durability and longevity.</p><h3><strong>Teamwork and patient comfort</strong></h3><p>The procedure was carried out under full anesthesia under the supervision of an experienced team of anesthesiologists, thus guaranteeing maximum safety and comfort for the patient.</p><p><br></p><p>The treatment was performed by an implant surgeon and a prosthodontist, whose precise teamwork ensured a foreseeable, high-quality, and aesthetically flawless outcome.</p></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="portfolio-examples__footer"><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><!--]--></section><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section id="process" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-process;"><div class="process-team u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="process-team-block"><div class="process-team-block__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->First-time clients are received by<!--]--></h2></div><div class="process-team__body"><div class="process-team-member-grid"><!--[--><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(20vmin);--end-transform:translateY(-20vmin);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Dr_Aleksejevs" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Aleksejevs_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Dr. Vladislavs Aleksejevs</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Clinic Head, Dentist</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">Dr. Vladislavs&nbsp;worked in the field of dentistry since 2014. A graduate of Riga StradiÅ†Å¡ University's Faculty of Dentistry,&nbsp;he studied inorganic chemistry at Harvard University.&nbsp;In 2018, he founded LAVA dental practice in Ludza. Two years later, in 2020, he founded LAVA dental studio in Riga.&nbsp;He specialises in aesthetic, digital dentistry and smile makeovers using veneers and&nbsp;regularly attends conferences and training courses in Latvia and abroad.&nbsp;You can find out more about Dr. Vladislavs' accomplishments in dentistry and everyday life on his Instagram page: @dr.aleksejevs</div></div></div><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(0);--end-transform:translateY(0);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Skidans_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Skidans_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Dr_Skidans" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Dr_Skidans_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Dr. Miroslav Skidan</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Dentist, Surgeon</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">Dr. Miroslav&nbsp;has worked in the field of dentistry since 2010, specialising in surgery and implantology.&nbsp;After studying dentistry in Ukraine, he has worked as a dentist in Latvia for eight years.&nbsp;In 2019, he advanced his specialization as an implantologist in Porto, Portugal with the leading periodontist, implantologist Dr. Algridas PuiÅ¡ys in a 5-day practical training course.&nbsp;He trained with the maxillofacial surgeon Dr. Pedro Rodrigues in Braga, Portugal.&nbsp;All-on-4 implants or all on four is a prosthetics method that allows you to restore the entire row of teeth in one day, using only four implants.Regularly attends foreign courses and training in dentistry.</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="process-team-block"><div class="process-team-block__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Our coordinators will take care of the treatment process<!--]--></h2></div><div class="process-team__body"><div class="process-team-member-grid"><!--[--><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(20vmin);--end-transform:translateY(-20vmin);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image process-team-member__image" alt="Elina" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Elina_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">ElÄ«na Volkova</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Treatment Plan Coordinator</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">A graduate of Riga's â€œVictoriaâ€ Vocational Secondary School, ElÄ«na specialises in customer service and administrative work. Parallel to her job at LAVA Dental Studio, she is studying for a Bachelorâ€™s degree in International Marketing and Sales Management, improving her knowledge in the field of communication and management.&nbsp;</div></div></div><div class="process-team-member-grid__item process-team-member" style="--start-transform:translateY(0);--end-transform:translateY(0);"><div class="process-team-member__header"><img width="680" height="850" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif 1x, /cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image--loaded process-team-member__image" alt="Viktorija GriÅ¡eva" loading="lazy" src="/cms/api/media/file/LavaDental_Viktorija_72dpi-680x850.avif"></div><div class="process-team-member__info"><h3 class="process-team-member__name u-text-body-large">Viktorija GriÅ¡eva</h3><div class="process-team-member__role u-text-body-xsmall">Administrator, Treatment Plans Coordinator&nbsp;</div><div class="process-team-member__description u-wysiwyg">At LAVA Dental Studio, Viktorija combines administrative duties with the role of treatment plan coordinator, helping patients to go through the entire treatment process step by step safely and confidently.&nbsp;
A balanced and internally strong personality, Viktorija remains calm in even the most difficult situations, invariably finding the most appropriate solution. She encourages patients and helps to coordinate the course of treatment in accordance with their wishes and means, ensuring that they have a well-planned and comfortable experience.&nbsp;</div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section class="section-feedback" id="feedback" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-feedback;"><div class="feedback-reviews u-bg-primary section-feedback__reviews"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="feedback-reviews__header"><h2 class="section-title u-text-headings-large"><!--[-->Reviews<!--]--></h2></div><div class="feedback-reviews__body"><div class="feedback-reviews-box"><div class="feedback-reviews-box__content"><!--[--><div class="feedback-review-item" style=""><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>They use a modern and effective cleaning method,&nbsp;and my&nbsp;teeth&nbsp;now&nbsp;feel great.&nbsp;The option&nbsp;to choose additional services.&nbsp;Iâ€™d&nbsp;definitely recommend&nbsp;it!&nbsp;5/5 stars!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Eduards</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I&nbsp;visited&nbsp;this dental clinic for professional oral hygiene and was&nbsp;extremely satisfied.&nbsp;The staff&nbsp;are&nbsp;kind and&nbsp;helpful, the atmosphere is calm and pleasant.&nbsp;The hygienist worked very carefully and gently, explaining&nbsp;the whole process,&nbsp;and&nbsp;giving&nbsp;useful tips for oral health.After the&nbsp;treatment,&nbsp;my teeth became clean and fresh. It was a&nbsp;great&nbsp;feeling!&nbsp;Iâ€™d definitely recommend this clinic to anyone who wants high-quality&nbsp;and&nbsp;professional care.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">JeÄ¼ena GÅ¾ibovska</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>After my first visit to this clinic, Iâ€™m&nbsp;finally no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;scared of going to the dentist. Perfect!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Monta MineiÄ·e</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>I visited Lava Dental Studio for a comprehensive diagnosis â€“&nbsp;it was&nbsp;a very professional and pleasant experience!&nbsp;From the&nbsp;very&nbsp;first moment I felt that I was in good hands â€“ the staff were&nbsp;kind, explained&nbsp;everything&nbsp;clearly&nbsp;to me, and the examination was carried out carefully and with modern equipment.</p><p>Iâ€™m now&nbsp;waiting for&nbsp;my&nbsp;next&nbsp;appointment, when&nbsp;Iâ€™ll receive a personalised treatment plan, but I can already say â€“&nbsp;the&nbsp;level of service&nbsp;is very high&nbsp;and&nbsp;I get the&nbsp;feeling that they really care about each patient.</p><p>I definitely recommend&nbsp;them&nbsp;to anybody&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;high-quality dental services in Riga!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Silvestrs Vaitkevics</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Iâ€™m one of those people who WAS very&nbsp;scared&nbsp;of the dentist, because I have a panicky&nbsp;fear of needles and&nbsp;until now&nbsp;Iâ€™ve been fixing my teeth without anaesthesia for 19 years.&nbsp;An acquaintance&nbsp;recommended the Lava Dental Clinic to me.&nbsp;I researched it on the internet and&nbsp;concluded&nbsp;that I had to go for a consultation.&nbsp;When I&nbsp;got&nbsp;here, I&nbsp;received a very warm welcome.&nbsp;The girls on the staff are fantastic and very nice!&nbsp;Before&nbsp;my&nbsp;first&nbsp;appointment to correct&nbsp;my teeth,&nbsp;my insides were shaking, I felt as if&nbsp;Iâ€™d&nbsp;cry from fear, but before that I had to fill out a questionnaire with my wishes, where&nbsp;I&nbsp;mentioned that Iâ€™m paranoid about needles.&nbsp;I entered&nbsp;the office, lay down in fear and didn't even blink.&nbsp;But what surprised me was that, without my noticing, the dentist&nbsp;took the syringe and I didn't even feel that I was being injected.&nbsp;Of course,&nbsp;I shed a tear&nbsp;out&nbsp;of fear, but I&nbsp;neednâ€™t have bothered, because&nbsp;there were no&nbsp;worries.&nbsp;I put on my headphones, choose my favourite Netflix series, and the&nbsp;dental treatment&nbsp;could&nbsp;begin!&nbsp;The best feeling, lying&nbsp;there for 2.5 hours,&nbsp;was that at some point you forget where you are, fall asleep,&nbsp;and&nbsp;at the same time youâ€™re being taken care of with all the&nbsp;very latest&nbsp;modern innovations.&nbsp;The doctors do their job, I can even say, PERFECTLY, with care and love.&nbsp;Comparing&nbsp;my&nbsp;previous dental&nbsp;care&nbsp;and the appearance of&nbsp;my&nbsp;repaired teeth beforehand, the picture is&nbsp;akin to&nbsp;night and day!&nbsp;</p><p>I can definitely recommend this clinic and Iâ€™ll personally return here again and again whenever&nbsp;I need to&nbsp;in life.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Madara Freiberga</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The&nbsp;only dental clinic in my life that Iâ€™m&nbsp;happy to&nbsp;visit&nbsp;and spend money at!!&nbsp;[..]&nbsp;The&nbsp;staffare amazing!&nbsp;Incredibly nice people and professionals in their field!&nbsp;Words cannot describe it&nbsp;â€“&nbsp;you have to experience it, and Iâ€™m not afraid to recommend this dental clinic to anyone!&nbsp;</p><p>I wish you many productive years of work, dear Lava&nbsp;dental&nbsp;studio!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Dace KrÅ«ziÅ†a</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The&nbsp;very&nbsp;best place to get your teeth cleaned, the service and&nbsp;welcome&nbsp;are top&nbsp;class. Thank you!!!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">KristÄ«ne KaÅ¾oka</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A very calm and pleasant atmosphere.&nbsp;I felt&nbsp;as if I was&nbsp;in safe hands.&nbsp;Everything&nbsp;wasexplained&nbsp;to me,&nbsp;helping me&nbsp;to understand every detail of the treatment plan!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">LÄsma BrenÄa</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Definitely the TOP clinic in Riga!!! Iâ€™d like to thank Dr. Vladislavs for&nbsp;a comprehensive&nbsp;visit, Iâ€™ll continue my treatment according to the&nbsp;prepared&nbsp;plan.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Deniss Rimavcevs</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>A friendly welcome upon arrival, which already&nbsp;leaves&nbsp;you feeling&nbsp;cared&nbsp;for.&nbsp;Punctual appointment, which youâ€™re&nbsp;always reminded&nbsp;about, if possible, offers different times for maintenance (which I really like).&nbsp;The doctors are competent,&nbsp;advise you on the best treatment plan and recommend whatâ€™s suitable or not&nbsp;for me.&nbsp;My favourite part&nbsp;is the&nbsp;headphones&nbsp;â€“&nbsp;I don't have to listen to&nbsp;my teeth&nbsp;being fixed, I&nbsp;just&nbsp;watch "FRIENDS" and sometimes&nbsp;even&nbsp;forget where I am.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Toms Talle</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Wonderful&nbsp;service and&nbsp;fantastic&nbsp;specialists!&nbsp;Surgeon Miroslav extracted my&nbsp;wisdom teeth very quickly, skilfully and painlessly.</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">DÄvis UÄ¼Ä£is</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Very pleasant service and professional doctors!&nbsp;I can 100% recommend Dr. Miroslav,&nbsp;mywisdom teeth surgery was very successful, painless&nbsp;with a fast&nbsp;rehabilitation process.&nbsp;Every&nbsp;visit&nbsp;I&nbsp;make&nbsp;is&nbsp;easy&nbsp;and stress-free.&nbsp;Thank you!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Evelina Avlasina</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Entering LAVA, the atmosphere was&nbsp;hard to put into words.&nbsp;From the smell, to the interior and the staff.&nbsp;Iâ€™d like to say a special thank you to hygienist DiÄna Zamarina for&nbsp;her wonderful&nbsp;communication, and&nbsp;for doing an&nbsp;even better job!&nbsp;Iâ€™ll definitely&nbsp;return&nbsp;and recommend it!!!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Elina Vasiljeva</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Very good dentists,&nbsp;who&nbsp;explain everything. No&nbsp;pain, no fear, everythingâ€™s comfortable and convenient, so much so that I could fall asleep in the dentist's chair!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">VitÄlijs Meija</div></div><div class="feedback-review-item" style="display:none;"><div class="feedback-review-item__quote u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Extremely&nbsp;kind and pleasant service, friendly staff.&nbsp;Result and atmosphere 10/10,&nbsp;delighted&nbsp;to&nbsp;make return visits.&nbsp;Highly recommended!</p></div></div><div class="feedback-review-item__name u-text-body-large">Veronika Å teÅ†a</div></div><!--]--></div><div class="feedback-reviews-box__footer"><div class="carousel-autoplay carousel-autoplay--paused" style="--autoplay-item-duration:5000ms;"><button class="carousel-autoplay__button" aria-label="Play carousel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><g><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 14.741a1 1 0 0 1 1.504-.864l9.015 5.26a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.727l-9.015 5.259A1 1 0 0 1 16 25.259z"></path></g></svg></button><div class="carousel-autoplay__dots"><!--[--><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot--active carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 6"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 7"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 8"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 9"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 10"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 11"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 12"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 13"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 14"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 15"></button><!--]--></div></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="feedback-instagram u-bg-primary section-feedback__instagram"><div class="container container--size-default"><!-