height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/e05ca2873721-05.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><img src="/assets/img/c5dac772c117-06.avif" width="412" height="512" class="image-carousel__image" alt="" loading="lazy" style="display:none;"><!--]--></div><div class="carousel-autoplay carousel-autoplay--paused image-carousel__controls" style="--autoplay-item-duration:5000ms;"><button class="carousel-autoplay__button" aria-label="Play carousel"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 40 40"><g><path fill="currentColor" d="M16 14.741a1 1 0 0 1 1.504-.864l9.015 5.26a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.727l-9.015 5.259A1 1 0 0 1 16 25.259z"></path></g></svg></button><div class="carousel-autoplay__dots"><!--[--><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot--active carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 1"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 2"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 3"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 4"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 5"></button><button class="carousel-autoplay__dot" aria-label="Go to slide 6"></button><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">In our care, youâ€™ll receive not only treatment and a perfect smile, but also care, openness and support all the way to the result. Our mission is to change the perception of dentistry. </p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Music, ambiance and a finely designed interior together with a specially tailored atmosphere will enable you to experience a completely different dentistry — one that is comfortable, calm and inspiring.</p>
<p>We want your experience with us to be like flying in first class — personal, convenient and with no worries or stress.</p>
</div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--footer"><!--[--><button class="button button--type-secondary button--icon-end"><div class="button__text u-text-body-button"><!--[-->Make an appointment<!--]--></div><!----></button><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section><!--]--></div><div class="overlay-section"><!--[-->
<section id="faq" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-faq;"><div class="faq u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="faq__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">Before you start, you might want to know more.</h2></div><div class="faq__body"><div class="faq-categories"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style="display:none;"><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title"></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Is it true that an implant might not integrate successfully?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Nowadays, this can be called a myth, because implants are completely suitable for all people, because we have a wide range of different implant systems available, which we use in your specific situation. In certain cases, we may decline to perform implant placement surgery: in cases of various chronic diseases, for example, in the case of diabetics, immunosuppressed patients, as well as smokers (tobacco products) and drug addicts are included in the risk group.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Why should a missing tooth be replaced with an implant?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>When a tooth is lost, the opposing bite teeth and adjacent teeth rush to take the place of the missing tooth, as a result of which you lose the proportions of the physiological bite within a few years, and you may start to have problems with the jaw joint (noises, pain, etc.), as well as the adjacent teeth may become more sensitive to cold, hot, sour, salty, sweet, which may require treatment or even extraction of other teeth. Therefore, we recommend replacing the missing tooth within 1 year of its loss.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Which implant systems does LAVA Dental Studio use?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>We work with Swiss Straumann implants and Neodent GM implants from the Straumann Group.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.30000000000000004s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How quickly can I get a new smile with the ALL-ON-X method?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The short answer — within one day! But please note that there will be temporary teeth on the implants. The permanent tooth structure will be placed after approximately 4 months, when the implants have healed.</p><p>The path to ALL-ON-X begins with a detailed diagnosis.</p><p><br></p><ol class="list-number"><li class="" style="" value="1">First of all, you need to start with detailed examinations and come to the Comprehensive diagnostics. During this appointment, several painless diagnostic examinations are performed, on the basis of which your individual treatment plan is created.</li><li class="" style="" value="2">Based on the examinations during the Comprehensive diagnostics appointment, a personalized treatment plan is prepared for you with further treatment steps, clear pricing and treatment timelines. If, after the presentation of the treatment plan, you decide to start the procedure, additional consultations are no longer necessary. The doctor already has all the necessary information so that you come to the next appointment for implant placement.</li><li class="" style="" value="3">During this appointment, the surgeon performs a painless placement of the necessary implants. The dental technician will make a temporary prosthesis for you on the spot, which will be installed on the implants. This procedure is painless, as anaesthesia is used, and it is also possible to perform sedation with laughing gas for maximum relaxation. The procedure takes approximately 8 hours and involves a team of four specialists. After the procedure, you leave the clinic with a temporary smile and feeling more confident!</li><li class="" style="" value="4">After approximately 4 months, when the implants have healed, permanent teeth with high aesthetics are installed, which completely replace natural teeth both visually and functionally.</li></ol><p>Your new smile is complete!</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.4s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How much does treatment with the ALL-ON-X method cost?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Comprehensive diagnostics + Treatment plan: â‚¬230</p><p>Placement of 4 or 6 implants: from â‚¬7,000</p><p>Permanent bridge: from â‚¬5,000 </p><p>        </p><p>The exact treatment cost is determined after the presentation of your Complex diagnostics and treatment plan.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.5s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">What is the difference between a 4-implant and a 6-implant supported restoration?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>The difference lies only in the number of implants supporting the fixed dental bridge. </p><p><br></p><p>After a Complex diagnostics session, a medical board will determine which method is best for your specific case, and this does not affect the final cost.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.6000000000000001s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Does the clinic offer instalment payment options?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Yes, our clinic collaborates with the Citadele Bank Klix loan platform.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.7000000000000001s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">How soon can I return to work after an ALL-ON-X procedure?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>After the procedure, the clinicâ€™s doctors provide detailed surgical documentation that can be submitted to your family doctor for sick leave arrangements. </p><p><br></p><p>Please keep in mind that this is a surgical procedure, and every patient recovers at their own pace. However, at least one week of rest is generally recommended.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section>
<section id="contacts" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-contacts;"><div class="contacts u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="contacts__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">We are right here. </h2></div><div class="contacts__body"><div class="image-info-box"><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--aside"><!--[--><img width="740" height="627" data-nuxt-img="" srcset="/assets/img/1de9caf9aa9f-map.svg 1x, /assets/img/dd2271325196-map.svg 2x" onerror="this.setAttribute('data-error', 1)" class="image image-info-box__image" alt="Map" loading="lazy" src="/assets/img/1de9caf9aa9f-map.svg"><!--]--></div><div class="image-info-box__item image-info-box__item--main"><div class="scroll-box"><div class="vertical-scroll-progress-bar vertical-scroll-progress-bar--theme-primary scroll-box__progress-bar"></div><div class="scroll-box__header"><p class="u-text-body-large">Conveniently located to make your appointment even easier. With easy access for people with mobility impairments. </p><!----></div><div class="scroll-box__body"><!--[--><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><p>Our studio is located at AusekÄ¼a Street 14, where there are parking spaces in Zone B. We will pay for your parking while you are at LAVA dental.</p>
